          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " The x87 FPU is a 16-bits register whose fields are as follows:",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1735,
            1801
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": "",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1806,
            1809
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " | 12-15 | 10-11 | 8-9 | 6-7 |  5 |  4 |  3 |  2 |  1 |  0 |",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1814,
            1877
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " |------:|------:|----:|----:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1882,
            1945
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " |       | RC    | PC  |     | PM | UM | OM | ZM | DM | IM |",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1950,
            2013
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": "",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            2018,
            2021
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " The documentation for all of the fields is available in the IA-32 Architectures Software",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            2026,
            2118
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " Developer's Manual (Volume 1).",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            2123,
            2157
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": "",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            2162,
            2165
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " The only field which is relevant for the following code is PC, Precision Control. This",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            2170,
            2260
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " field determines the precision of the operations performed by the FPU. It can be set to:",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            2265,
            2357
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": "  - 0b00, single precision i.e., 32-bits",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            2362,
            2405
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": "  - 0b10, double precision i.e., 64-bits",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            2410,
            2453
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": "  - 0b11, double extended precision i.e., 80-bits (default state)",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            2458,
            2526
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " The 0b01 value is reserved and should not be used.",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            2531,
            2585
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        }
